  "headline": "Syrian army soldier killed in attack in Deir ez-Zor countryside",
  "pages": [
    {
      "text": "A Syrian army soldier was killed on Monday during an attack by unidentified gunmen in al-Baghuz, located in the eastern countryside of Deir ez-Zor, Syria, according to a source at the Syrian Defense Ministry. The source told Syria’s Al-Iikhbariya TV that the soldier was killed in what was described as a treacherous attack."
    }
  ]
}

